WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.520
I saw the universe by its warmth.

2
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:13.810
Infrared light let me see newborn stars hidden in dust and the glow of planets around other suns.

3
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:19.540
I helped discover seven Earth-sized planets around one small star.

4
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:27.040
My coolant ran out, but I kept working for ten more years while I drifted further behind Earth.

5
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.760
I saw the universe by its warmth.
